  reason: "The seed compile closure must load the declaration T? denotes (optional_declaration_ref) without minting a kernel Optional. Detection is a parse fact on ParsedFileReferences; module_paths_of_references adds that module path; a pool that does not hold it refuses typed. The collector runs inside v1's own resolve path, the same bootstrap ordering that keeps the rest of parsed_file_references in the seed. Hand-item delta +2 (one walk, one refusal constructor). ParsedFileReferences.demands_optional_declaration is a struct field, not a citable item. Existing items parsed_file_references, module_paths_of_references, reference_pull_paths_for_source and referenced_module_paths_of_source are ExistingSeedItemModified, not netted. Two controls in annotation_erased_scan_projection (existing module) execute the parse fact and the missing-module refusal.",
